    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>“The stones keep what the rest of us tried to throw away.”</em></p><p><strong>Read the Strata (1/Soma Break).</strong> Spend 10 minutes with a structure, ruin, battlefield, or natural formation older than a century. The GM answers two true questions about it: one about how it was built or formed, and one about the last decade of its occupation or use.</p><p>This is a separate use from the ancestry's <em>Hex Recognition</em> and they do not share a pool.</p>",
